#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:71
msgid ""
"On the Price Sets tab, associate all relevant Price Sets with the Plan. "
"The desired Price Sets must already exist. If needed, you may save the "
"Plan at this point and come back to associate Price Sets later"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:72
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
